    {
      "id": "代码块",
      "title": "代码块",
      "subtitle": "",
      "type": "mixed",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "```python\ndef bubble_sort(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n):\n        swapped = False\n        for j in range(0, n - i - 1):\n            if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:\n                arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]\n                swapped = True\n        if not swapped:\n            break\n    return arr\n```"
        ],
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "description",
            "data": [
              "```python\ndef bubble_sort(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    for i in range(n):\n        swapped = False\n        for j in range(0, n - i - 1):\n            if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:\n                arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]\n                swapped = True\n        if not swapped:\n            break\n    return arr\n```"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
